        <div class="faq-answer"><p>RFID-powered inventory provides 99.9% accuracy across every store and warehouse globally. Each unit is individually tracked by EPC. If only 3 units of an overcoat remain — one in Paris, one in London, one in Milan — the system knows exactly where they are and prevents any channel from selling a ghost unit. For small production runs where a cancelled order means losing a high-value client, this precision is essential.</p></div>
